<opsproc code="00008979.0002001" revdate="2020-11-12T14:33:26"><title>GALY &amp; CAB Manual Load Shed System (<tech-label type="pb-sw">GALY &amp; CAB</tech-label>)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.004"><title>On ground or in flight</title><procbody lid="N.00008979.0002001.005"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008979.0002001.002" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.006" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the <emph bold="false" color="Red" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="false">SMOKE / FUMES / AVNCS SMOKE</emph> <abb>QRH</abb> procedure is applied, replace the action to set the <tech-label type="pb-sw">GALY &amp; CAB</tech-label> to OFF by the following actions:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008979.0002001.007"><action-block lid="N.00008979.0002001.008"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.009" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008979.0002001.003"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">EMER EXIT LT</tech-label></challenge><response>As required</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.010" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008979.0002001.004"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">COMMERCIAL</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></action-block><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.012"><noteproc code="00008979.0002001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.013"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008979.0002001.014">When the <tech-label type="pb-sw">COMMERCIAL</tech-label> is set to OFF, the normal cabin lighting goes off. Minimum cabin
lighting is recovered when the <tech-label type="sel">EMER EXIT LT</tech-label> is set to ON.</para></noteproc></inform></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>